    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Frenzy VR is an action fighter all about destruction &amp; interactive environments. </h2>You can use **any object** as a weapon with our advanced destruction physics for realistic mayhem. Frenzy VR includes a **story mode** with deep narrative secrets, levels, and objectives. Take the chaos into your own hands with **free play modes** allowing unlimited creativity across **various maps** like offices, apartments, prisons, and more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/4440275d4882e7a09972790f764e31c0.avif?t=1726777017\" data-has-big /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULLY INTERACTIVE AND DESTRUCTIBLE WORLDS</strong></h2>All maps feature fully destructible items, objects, &amp; enemies<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1b3a2e30de6c9c581ed7c4b690501ba2.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1b3a2e30de6c9c581ed7c4b690501ba2.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1b3a2e30de6c9c581ed7c4b690501ba2.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RAGDOLL PHYSICS WITH MELEE / RANGED WEAPONS</strong></h2>NPCs use realistic physics ragdolls for ultimate chaos and mayhem<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1bfb1eb4f4b92a0dbfcd0f18fdfb0c2d.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1bfb1eb4f4b92a0dbfcd0f18fdfb0c2d.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/1bfb1eb4f4b92a0dbfcd0f18fdfb0c2d.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY MODE WITH NARRATIVE AND CAMPAIGN</strong></h2>Complete the full story with multiple missions and take down the Reborn Company<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/d74eb3fb2c50a981099cd2f39b2a3e31.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/d74eb3fb2c50a981099cd2f39b2a3e31.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/d74eb3fb2c50a981099cd2f39b2a3e31.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>10+ REALISTIC MAPS AND MISSIONS</strong></h2>Go ballistic in fully interactable worlds built specifically for you to destroy <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/deb04213da029065232a5c9e39f8c45a.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/deb04213da029065232a5c9e39f8c45a.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/deb04213da029065232a5c9e39f8c45a.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION AND UPGRADES</strong></h2>Realistic gun and melee weapon physics that feel just like real life<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/e58a40580099c6270d70b07f59cc0857.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/e58a40580099c6270d70b07f59cc0857.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/e58a40580099c6270d70b07f59cc0857.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIGHT VICIOUS AND CRAZY NPCS</strong></h2>Show no mercy as you fight back against the corrupt NPCs<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/0980e9ba9e42d20b0e1b5d673b70ca66.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/0980e9ba9e42d20b0e1b5d673b70ca66.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/0980e9ba9e42d20b0e1b5d673b70ca66.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXTRA MINIGAMES AND GAMEMODES</strong></h2>You'll never run out of things to do with our infinitely replayable gamemodes<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/7590fc27f8a424a21c284ae7a0d2c913.poster.avif?t=1726777017\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/7590fc27f8a424a21c284ae7a0d2c913.webm?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750110/extras/7590fc27f8a424a21c284ae7a0d2c913.mp4?t=1726777017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
